(1, 'The Blue Heaven', 6000000.00, 'RCC', '2022-01-01', '2024-11-30', 'Completed', '[\"67740cb2759cb_dwdw.jpg\",\"67740cb276343_xsv.jpg\",\"67740cb27663e_2.jpg\",\"67740cb276a44_Untitled-1.jpg\",\"67740cb276e37_3.jpg\"]', 'The Blue Haven Residencies is a 14-storey residential project by RCC that sets a new standard for luxury residences in the Maldives and is set to become a defining feature of the Hulhumaleâ€™ skyline. Set within the lush, green foliage of Hulhumaleâ€™, the tower resonates a sense of savoir-vivre with its exquisite craftsmanship, modern flair, and time-honored architectural excellence. Each of the 116 apartments offered are masterfully designed to utilize maximum space and to showcase a well-defined flow between living, dining and other private areas. Designed for luxury and grandeur, Blue Haven is as lavish as it gets.\r\nThe Blue Haven Residencies is located at the intersection between Kuredhimaa Higun and Hithigas Magu, in Phase 1 Hulhumaleâ€™', '2024-12-31 15:24:34'),
(2, 'H.VIOLET MEED - PROPOSED 11 STOREY RESIDENCE AT MALE\' (PHASE 01 - GROUND TO 3RD FLOOR ONLY)', 0.00, 'MR. IBRAHIM AZIM', '0001-01-01', '0001-01-01', 'Active', '[\"678b9945e7f7a_MicrosoftTeams-image-20-scaled-1.jpg\"]', 'S', '2025-01-09 07:11:55'),
