(11, 'BATCHING PLANT , LOT#10708', 1.00, 'RCC', '2021-03-03', '2030-01-02', 'Active', '[\"679f0faa3030d_BATCHING PLANT.jpg\"]', 'RCC Batching Plants are specialized in roller-compacted concrete (RCC) production, designed for efficient and accurate batching of aggregates, cement, and water. This results in high-quality concrete mixes suitable for various construction applications, such as dams, roads, airports, and industrial flooring.', '2025-02-02 06:24:42'),
